message.content:
Initial candidate:
```json
{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "name": "eurusd-trend-ema-rsi",
  "description": "EMA crossover with RSI filter for EURUSD long-side trend following.",
  "rationale": "EMA 9/21 crossover detects momentum shifts; RSI above 50 filters out weak signals. ATR bracket exits manage trade risk.",
  "timeframes": ["H1"],
  "symbols": ["EURUSD"],
  "indicators": [
    {"id": "ema9",  "kind": "ema", "params": {"period": 9}},
    {"id": "ema21", "kind": "ema", "params": {"period": 21}},
    {"id": "rsi14", "kind": "rsi", "params": {"period": 14}},
    {"id": "atr14", "kind": "atr", "params": {"period": 14}}
  ],
  "entries": [
    {"side": "long", "when": "ema9 > ema21 and rsi14 > 50"}
  ],
  "exits": [
    {"side": "long", "sl_atr": 1.5, "tp_atr": 3.0}
  ],
  "risk": {
    "size": "atr",
    "atr_mult": 1.5,
    "fixed_lots": 0.01,
    "max_concurrent": 1,
    "hedge": false,
    "cool_down_bars": 2
  },
  "code": null
}
```

Weaknesses identified: 1) RSI threshold of 50 may generate false signals in ranging markets. 2) Only 2-bar cooldown is insufficient to avoid over-trading. 3) Single timeframe lacks multi-period confirmation. Revised manifest:
```json
{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "name": "eurusd-trend-ema-adx",
  "description": "EMA crossover with ADX trend-strength filter for higher-quality EURUSD long entries.",
  "rationale": "EMA 9/21 crossover with ADX above 25 ensures only strong-trending market conditions are traded. RSI above 55 adds momentum confirmation. Increased cooldown reduces overtrading.",
  "timeframes": ["H1"],
  "symbols": ["EURUSD"],
  "indicators": [
    {"id": "ema9",  "kind": "ema", "params": {"period": 9}},
    {"id": "ema21", "kind": "ema", "params": {"period": 21}},
    {"id": "rsi14", "kind": "rsi", "params": {"period": 14}},
    {"id": "adx14", "kind": "adx", "params": {"period": 14}},
    {"id": "atr14", "kind": "atr", "params": {"period": 14}}
  ],
  "entries": [
    {"side": "long", "when": "ema9 > ema21 and rsi14 > 55 and adx14 > 25"}
  ],
  "exits": [
    {"side": "long", "sl_atr": 1.5, "tp_atr": 3.5}
  ],
  "risk": {
    "size": "atr",
    "atr_mult": 1.5,
    "fixed_lots": 0.01,
    "max_concurrent": 1,
    "hedge": false,
    "cool_down_bars": 5
  },
  "code": null
}
```
